Detector: constant-function-asm
usingOraclize.getCodeSize(address) (contracts/safe/safe_227_SAFE.sol#530-534) is declared view but contains assembly code
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#constant-functions-using-assembly-code

Detector: divide-before-multiply
Game.startSettlementProcess() (contracts/safe/safe_227_SAFE.sol#1105-1124) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- extractedFees = totalBetsValue / 100 * fees (contracts/safe/safe_227_SAFE.sol#1112)
Game.pay(uint256,bytes32) (contracts/safe/safe_227_SAFE.sol#1219-1242) performs a multiplication on the result of a division:
	- payout = ((rounds[_roundNumber].totalBetsValueWithoutFees * (bet.amount * 1000 / winnersTotalValue)) / 1000) (contracts/safe/safe_227_SAFE.sol#1235)
Reference: https://github.com/crytic/slither/wiki/Detector-Documentation#divide-before-multiply

